        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8464, Rope Edge Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nElegant in both shape and style, this Rope Edge Single Cylinder Deadbolt made by Emtek is crafted out of solid brass. It features a rope around its circumference. A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. The Rope Single Cylinder Deadbolt will fit doors 1-1/4 inches thick to 3 inches thick with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Rope Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Rope Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Diameter with Exterior Ring: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Diameter without Exterior Ring: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Projection with Exterior Ring: 1-1/16”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Projection without Exterior Ring: 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Thickness: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-7-finish.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Rope Single Cylinder Deadbolt",
                "description": "Elegant in both shape and style, this Rope Edge Single Cylinder Deadbolt made by Emtek is crafted out of solid brass. It features a rope around its circumference. A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. The Rope Single Cylinder Deadbolt will fit doors 1-1/4 inches thick to 3 inches thick with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
